{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":34,"kin":35,"engines":60,"usedOn":61,"sites":62,"crewed":67,"museums":68,"hero":69},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/gps-gnss.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":28,"tagline":13,"description":32},"gps-gnss","GPS（全球定位系统）","constellation","USSF","USA","Lockheed Martin / Boeing (varied by block)","1978-02-22","ACTIVE","1981-2011","iss-assembly","最初的GNSS——31颗卫星，自2000年起提供免费公共服务","US Space Force GPS Operations. Originally a Department of Defense system; civilian unencrypted L1 C/A signal freely available worldwide.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Global Positioning System — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Positioning_System","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"GPS.gov (US government info)","https://www.gps.gov/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"US Space Force GPS operations","https://www.spaceforce.mil/News/Topics/GPS/","deep",[29],{"type":30,"site_id":31},"earth-object","gps","全球定位系统 — 最初的GNSS，也是目前使用最广泛的系统。31颗活跃卫星在高度20,180 km处，分布在6个轨道平面，倾角55°。由美国太空军操作；最初由国防部管理。1983年里根总统的指令在大韩航空007班机被击落后承诺未来向民众开放GPS接入，但民用非加密L1 C/A信号接入直到2000年5月关闭选择可用性才成为可能，大幅提升了民用精度。Block IIF和III卫星搭载现代化的L1C、L2C、L5信号。",[],[],[36,40,44,48,52,56],{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"sbirs-heo","SBIRS-HEO","美国搭载于机密Tundra轨道平台的预警红外传感器",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"goes-noaa","GOES（NOAA气象卫星）","NOAA地球静止气象卫星双星——持续覆盖美洲",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"glonass","GLONASS","俄罗斯的GNSS——24颗卫星，于2011年恢复完整覆盖",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"landsat","Landsat","50+ 年连续地球成像 — Landsat 1 至 9",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"inmarsat","Inmarsat","GEO 移动通信——海事、航空、GMDSS 主干网",{"id":57,"name":58,"tagline":59},"molniya","Molniya","俄罗斯12小时HEO通信——63.4°临界轨道倾角将远地点锁定在北方上空",[],[],[63],{"type":30,"href":64,"name":65,"place":-1,"text":66},"/earth?id=gps","GPS星座","在轨卫星31颗，轨道高度20,200 km。每款导航应用、每架无人机、每艘海上船舶都依赖这一星座。原为军用，1983年向民用开放。信号精度：民用约3 m，军用约1 m——厘米级精度需要RTK增强。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/gps-gnss/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
